{"ID":"20240504170634-d0vjwxr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170634-d0vjwxr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170634-d0vjwxr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624092320-x8y9mek\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611122548-zjz6b3p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624092844-eufnvla\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"151孔公孽","type":"doc","updated":"20240813134815"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240813115924-izxzplo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813115924-izxzplo","updated":"20240813134457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"孔公孽"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/孔公孽-20240813115924-mnlo9p3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624092320-x8y9mek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624092320-x8y9mek","updated":"20240813134815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 706px;","style":"width: 696px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳-20240813134543-lsx4ipr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 696px;\" parent-style=\"width: 706px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731192124-yqsc4j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731192124-yqsc4j3","updated":"20240731192124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 709px;","style":"width: 699px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"钟乳"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/钟乳-20240731192048-l83fhim.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 699px;\" parent-style=\"width: 709px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624094304-z6e9cis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624094304-z6e9cis","updated":"20240813134822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳 1-20240813134648-k7mp13u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813134827-7bxybiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813134827-7bxybiz","updated":"20240813134827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石钟乳 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石钟乳 2-20240813134751-tsflvsc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624094046-6bafi75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624094046-6bafi75","updated":"20240624094730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：钟乳石中，根部为殷孽，中间部位为孔公孽，尖端部分才是钟乳石。李时珍记载，附石而生，粗者为殷孽，接殷孽而生以渐空通者为孔公孽，接孔公孽而生者为钟乳。盖殷孽如人之乳根，孔公孽如乳房，钟乳如乳头也。"}]},{"ID":"20240624094046-rbb8dsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624094046-rbb8dsj","updated":"20240624094046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：实际上真正的钟乳石里面是都有孔的，孔里面往下滴下的液体是含有碳酸钙的水，含有碳酸钙的水滴在地上久而久之就会形成石笋。这个含碳酸钙的水滴在石笋上溅出来落在岩石壁上或岩石底下，就会形成石花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122725-dvaodyf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122725-dvaodyf"}},{"ID":"20240611122821-b2xr4fr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122821-b2xr4fr","updated":"20240611122834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公蘖《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122821-ocfw3gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122821-ocfw3gn","updated":"20240611122821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122821-gu2ab3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122821-gu2ab3i","updated":"20240611122821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主伤食不化，邪结气，恶创，疽瘘痔，利九窍，下乳汁（《御览》引云，一名通石，《大观本》，作黑字）。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122821-jov7ter","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122821-jov7ter","updated":"20240611122821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：孔公孽，神农辛，岐伯咸，扁鹊酸无毒，色青黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122821-v9wuu7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122821-v9wuu7y","updated":"20240611122821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名通石，殷孽根也，青黄色生梁山。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122753-55zj7fo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122753-55zj7fo"}},{"ID":"20240611122807-ir6v858","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122807-ir6v858","updated":"20240611122813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122807-uym61js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122807-uym61js","updated":"20240611122807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主伤食不化，邪结气恶，疮疽 痔，利九窍。下乳汁，男子阴疮，女子阴蚀，及伤食，病常欲眠睡。一名通石，殷孽根也，青黄色。生梁山山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122753-z3zutv5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122753-z3zutv5"}},{"ID":"20240611122754-kge7dq7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122754-kge7dq7","updated":"20240611122800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122754-07uk1kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122754-07uk1kg","updated":"20240611122754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即殷孳床，色青黄，中有孔。味辛温，无毒。主伤食不化欲眠，腰冷膝痹，毒瓦斯，瘕结邪气，出声音，利九窍，下乳汁。治恶疮疽、 痔、男子阴疮、女子阴蚀。木兰为使，恶细辛，忌羊血。此二孽止可浸酒及煮服，不入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122540-8tj2gwd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122540-8tj2gwd"}},{"ID":"20240611122721-s3xcgth","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122721-s3xcgth","updated":"20240611122730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122721-swxzb71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122721-swxzb71","updated":"20240611122721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主伤食不化。邪结气。恶创疽痔。利九窍。下乳汁。一名通石。生山谷石垂芽孽。亡是呼公。角森。房妙空空。寐回遽觉。音审宣通。如调灵龠。呼吸中充。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122721-a3iwoii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122721-a3iwoii","updated":"20240611122721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰。孔窍空通。附垂于石。如木之芽孽。俗讹为孔公。汉书传。齐言亡是公者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122721-qr81qgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122721-qr81qgr","updated":"20240611122721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无是人也。宋书传。公何见呼为公。陶弘景曰。孽大如牛羊角。长二三尺。诗。其角。李时珍曰。孽为钟乳之房。论语。空空如也。庄子。成然寐蘧公觉。名医曰。治伤食病常欲眠睡。甄权曰。能使喉声圆亮。江总碑。老惊灵龠。苏轼诗。外慕渐少由中充。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122654-00mvbuj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122654-00mvbuj"}},{"ID":"20240611122711-1t3insc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122711-1t3insc","updated":"20240611122717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122711-nlxkq6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122711-nlxkq6i","updated":"20240611122711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主伤食不化，邪结气恶，疮疽 痔，利九窍，下乳汁，男子阴疮女子阴蚀，及伤食病，常欲眠睡。一名通石，殷孽根也。青黄色。生梁山山谷。（木兰为之使，恶细辛。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611122711-6bf38ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122711-6bf38ij","updated":"20240611122711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶梁山属冯翊郡，此即今钟乳床也，亦出始兴，皆大块打破之。凡钟乳之类，三种同一体，从石室上汁溜积久盘结者，为钟乳床，即此孔公孽也。其以小 者，为殷孽，今人呼为孔公孽。殷孽复溜轻好者为钟乳。虽同一类，而疗体为异，贵贱悬殊。此二孽不堪丸散，人皆捣末酒渍饮之，甚疗脚弱。其前诸疗，恐宜水煮为汤也。按今三种同根，而所生各处，当是随其土地为胜尔。唐本注云∶此孽次于钟乳，如牛、羊角者，中尚孔通，故名通石。《本经》误以为殷孽之根，陶根据《本经》以为今人之误，其实是也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本云∶凡钟乳之类有五种∶一钟乳、二殷孽、三孔公孽、四石床、五石花，虽同一体而主疗有异。此二孽只可酒浸，不堪入丸散药用，然甚疗脚弱，香港脚。石花、石床显在后条。吴氏云∶孔公孽，神农∶辛。歧伯∶咸。扁鹊∶酸，无毒。色青黄。药性论云∶孔公孽，忌羊血，味甘，有小毒。主治腰冷，膝痹，毒风，男女阴蚀疮。治人常欲多睡，能使喉声圆亮。日华子云∶孔公孽，味甘，暖。治症结。此即殷孽床也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122711-j8qw91l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122711-j8qw91l","updated":"20240611122711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具石钟乳条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122711-8paxa2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122711-8paxa2q","updated":"20240611122711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青霞子∶孽，轻身充肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122654-i6r8rn9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122654-i6r8rn9"}},{"ID":"20240611122655-ok6yjav","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122655-ok6yjav","updated":"20240611122706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122655-36lcljg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122655-36lcljg","updated":"20240611122700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒。主治男子阴疮，女子阴蚀，及伤食病，恒欲眠睡。一名通石，殷孽根也，色。生梁山。（木兰为之使，恶细辛。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611122541-ex6sbct","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122541-ex6sbct"}},{"ID":"20240611122610-rmmrt73","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122610-rmmrt73","updated":"20240611122615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122610-dctkg07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122610-dctkg07","updated":"20240611122610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主治伤食不化，邪结气，恶疮，疽， 痔，利九窍，下乳汁。治男子阴疮，女子阴蚀，及伤食病，恒欲眠睡。一名通石，殷孽根也，青黄色。生梁山山谷。（木兰为之使，恶细辛。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611122610-kldhbti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122610-kldhbti","updated":"20240611122610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梁山属冯翊郡，此即今钟乳床也，亦出始兴，皆大块折破之。凡钟乳之类，三种同一体，从石室上汁溜积久盘结者，为钟乳床，即此孔公孽也。其次长小 者，为殷孽，今人呼为孔公孽。殷孽复溜，轻好者为钟乳。虽同一类，而疗体为异，贵贱悬殊。此二孽不堪丸散，人皆捣末酒渍饮之，治脚弱。其前诸治，恐宜水煮为汤也。案今三种同根，而所生各异处，当是随其土地为胜尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122541-8ajuf0i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122541-8ajuf0i"}},{"ID":"20240611122546-t604lms","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-t604lms","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔公孽"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-gog9yvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-gog9yvj","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-nea4l3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-nea4l3e","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kǒnɡ Gōnɡ Niè"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-u7fi5vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-u7fi5vc","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-rq0rykc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-rq0rykc","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通石、孔公石"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-uxou1iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-uxou1iv","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-osacsvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-osacsvw","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孔公孽始载于《本经》，列于中品。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-qpi9dhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-qpi9dhl","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．《别录》云：“殷孽根也。青黄色，生梁山山谷。”陶弘景云：“凡钟乳之类，三种同一体。从石室上汁溜积久盘结者，为钟乳床，即此孔公孽也。其次以小双者为殷孽，今人呼为孔公孽。殷孽复溜轻好者为钟乳，虽同一类，而疗体为异，贵贱悬(政和作‘相’，大观作‘悬’)殊。”2．《新修本草》提出不同看法，并为正误，云：“此孽次于钟"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-0nn4iti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-0nn4iti","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-5x6p6th","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-5x6p6th","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为碳酸盐类方解石族矿物方解石的钟乳状集合体。中间稍细部分或有中空者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-x0ccc9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-x0ccc9h","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Stalactite"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-yaopu0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-yaopu0s","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：石灰岩山洞中采集，除去杂石，洗净。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-m46022a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-m46022a","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-vfgi57h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-vfgi57h","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：钏乳石系含碳酸钙的水溶液，经石灰岩裂隙，从溶洞顶滴下，因水分蒸发，二氧化碳散逸，使析出的碳酸钙淀积而成，且自上向下逐渐增长，倒垂于洞顶。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-4wokfhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-4wokfhx","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于山西、陕西、甘肃、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-16qrslm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-16qrslm","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-exb18y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-exb18y1","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 晶体结构属三方晶系。呈扁圆锥形、圆锥形及圆柱形。表面粗糙，凹凸不平。类白色，有的因含杂质而染成灰白色或浅棕黄白色等。玻璃光泽或暗淡。硬度3，性脆。断面较平整，可见同心层状构造成放射状构造，中心有的有空心。相对密度2.6-2.8。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-o0w5ocd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-o0w5ocd","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-tju8wp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-tju8wp2","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主含碳酸钙(CaC3)，其中CaO49.53%。含微量元素铁、铜、钾、锌、锰、镉(mg/g)分别为0.296%，1.65×10"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"-"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6，0.388%，154.0%，154×10"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"-"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6，13×10"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"-"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6。其他尚有镁、磷、钴、镍、铅、银、铬等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-ixaaym0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-ixaaym0","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-luyncus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-luyncus","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；辛；温"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-u7kmg0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-u7kmg0n","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-8v4gb3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-8v4gb3w","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺，肺热盛者及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-271r3lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-271r3lr","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经集注》：“恶细辛。”2.《药性论》：“忌羊血。”"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-j2r658h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-j2r658h","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-fq9vmlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-fq9vmlk","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通阳散寒；化瘀散结；解毒。主腰膝冷痛；症瘕结聚；饮食不化；恶疮；痔痿；乳汁不通"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-aulojnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-aulojnm","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-7u7nr0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-7u7nr0n","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g，打碎先煎；研末1.5-3g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-bog998w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-bog998w","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-6cpnwg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-6cpnwg2","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 李时珍云:“孔窍空通，附垂于石，如木之芽蘖，故曰孔空蘖，而俗讹为孔公尔。”孽、蘖义通，《群经正字》:“今经典作‘孽’。”"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-om4ssvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-om4ssvg","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-z5kln0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-z5kln0p","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《蜀本草》：“凡钟乳之类有五种，一钟乳，二殷孽，三孔公孽，四石床，五石花。虽一体而注疗有异。此二孽只可酒浸，不堪入丸散药用，然甚疗脚弱脚气。”2.《本草图经》：“孔公孽、殷孽既云是钟乳同生，则有孽处皆当有乳，今并不闻有之，岂用之既寡，则采者亦稀乎?抑时人不知孽中有乳，故不尽采乎?不能尽究也。”3.《纲目》：“以姜石、通石二石推之，则似附石生而粗者，为殷蘖；接殷蘖而生，以渐空通者，为孔公蘖；接孔公蘖而生者，为钟乳。当从苏恭之说为优。盖殷蘖如人之乳根，孔公蘖如乳房，钟乳如乳头也。”"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-q4noa6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-q4noa6d","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611122546-cvrng90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122546-cvrng90","updated":"20240611122546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611122547-poj7tdn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611122547-poj7tdn"}},{"ID":"20240611122548-zjz6b3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611122548-zjz6b3p"}}]}